	)
	(text_box "From chart, a K type TC has a voltage of about 8.1mV at a temperature of 200C.\n\nTo output 4V when the TC is at 200C, we need a gain of 4/0.0081=493.8 or 494."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 83.82 256.54 0)
